    "shortDescription": "Start with one drill and grow a mining fleet that spans the galaxy.",
    "description": "Start with a single hand drill on a lonely asteroid and grow a mining company that spans the galaxy.\n\n• Build seven kinds of machines, from rovers to mirrors around a star\n• Give every machine an AI pilot so it runs without you\n• Collect a small crew of specialists and level them up\n• A free supply pod drops every few hours, and daily missions pay in Dark Matter\n• Earn credits while the app is closed\n• Jump to a new galaxy to earn Warp Cores and grow faster every run\n• Keep one step ahead of Director Rook and his rock monopoly\n\nAsteroid Haul is a calm space incremental game for short breaks."
  },
